{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fields of Mine</strong> is a roguelike built on classic Minesweeper \u2014 but with twists that reward sharp eyes and smart choices.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/221\u0421\u043a\u0440\u0438\u043d\u0448\u043e\u0442\u044b_\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u044f.png?t=1748979791\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a branching map where each field is a puzzle. Some grids are altered by tricky effects: flipped numbers, hidden clues, extra mines, timed bombs, or trap tiles that trigger chain reactions. Before each boss, there's a moment to breathe \u2014 but after that, things only get harder.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/2\u0421\u043a\u0440\u0438\u043d\u0448\u043e\u0442\u044b_\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u044f.png?t=1748979791\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect golden tickets to spend in shops and gain upgrades: fewer mines, extra lives, shields, auto-flags or bonus safe reveals. The deeper you go, the harder it gets \u2014 but every mistake is a lesson. And if you fall short, you can always start fresh.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/2222222\u0421\u043a\u0440\u0438\u043d\u0448\u043e\u0442\u044b_\u043a\u043e\u043f\u0438\u044f.png?t=1748979791\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722690?t=1748979791","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722690?t=1748979791","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/bde4f36fee1096b0a5ae81d06d4126a2b644967a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748979791","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a